== ui_card "Button Helper"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_button(text, variance = :neutral, **options)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Buttons are the primary interaction points in the UI. The <code>ui_button</code> helper enforces consistency by:
  ul
    li Standardizing padding, border-radius, and typography.
    li ensuring accessibility focus states (via the <code>sp-btn</code> CSS class).
    li Reducing template clutter by abstracting class names.

  h3 Arguments
  table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem;"
    thead style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sp-border);"
      tr
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Name
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Type
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Description
    tbody
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" text
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The label of the button.
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" variance
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Symbol
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Visual style: <code>:primary</code>, <code>:neutral</code>, <code>:danger</code>. Default: <code>:neutral</code>.
      tr
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" options
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Hash
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Standard HTML attributes (e.g., <code>id</code>, <code>data-*</code>, <code>href</code>). Passing <code>href</code> renders an <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> tag.

  h3 Real World Scenarios
  
  h4 1. Primary Call to Action
  p Use for the main action on a page (e.g., "Save", "Submit").
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_button "Create Project", :primary
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code == ui_button "Create Project", :primary

  h4 2. Navigation Link
  p Passing an <code>href</code> automatically renders an anchor tag tailored to look like a button.
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_button "Go Home", :neutral, href: "/"
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code == ui_button "Go Home", :neutral, href: "/"
        
  h4 3. Destructive Action
  p Use for deletions or dangerous operations.
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_button "Delete Account", :danger, onclick: "confirm('Are you sure?')"
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code == ui_button "Delete Account", :danger, onclick: "confirm('Are you sure?')"

  h3 Playground
  p Try it out in the <a href="/docs/playground">Playground</a>.
